      "message": "It\u0027s interesting (and counter intuitive) that a patch to loosen permissions psi files prevents previously working access by system_server.\n\nMy only worry with this change is that it is a partial revert, and so the previous default permissions on the files are now more accessible w/o the CAP_SYS_RESOURCE guard.\n\nI suspect sepolicy might save the day in this case, but would a full revert of the problematic patch be a safer approach?",
