      "side": 1,
      "message": "Correct, this should be a full revert until we implement a better solution.\n\nThe loosening brakes our userspace because Android changes the file permissions during boot using init process that runs as root. Therefore non-root and non-CAP_SYS_RESOURCE processes still can access it.",
